<title>USA: PCA says 95 pct American Studios tendered.</title>
<headline>PCA says 95 pct American Studios tendered.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCA International Inc said its tender offer for all outstanding shares of American Studios Inc has expired and about 95 percent of American Studios shares have been tendered and accepted for payment.</p>
<p>In the offer, which expired January 22, 20,333,508 shares were tendered and accepted, including 109,239 shares tendered subject to notices of guaranteed delivery.</p>
<p>As previously announced, the remaining American Studios shares will be converted into the right to receive $2.50 per share in cash.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
